      <h2 class="sh sh--white" style="margin-bottom:28px;">How WST approaches<br><em>senior living communities.</em></h2>
      <div class="approach-item">
      <div class="approach-icon"><svg width="16" height="16" viewBox="0 0 16 16" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.5"><rect x="2" y="3" width="12" height="10" rx="1"/><path d="M5 7h6M5 10h4"/></svg></div>
      <div><div class="approach-title">Full Community Billing Audit &mdash; All Buildings &amp; Accounts</div><div class="approach-body">Every utility account across the campus reviewed. Sewer charges cross-referenced against metered consumption. Non-returned water volumes (cooling tower, laundry, irrigation) identified for exemption filing. Multi-building meter reconciliation across independent living, assisted living, and care facility accounts.</div></div>
    </div><div class="approach-item">
      <div class="approach-icon"><svg width="16" height="16" viewBox="0 0 16 16" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.5"><path d="M8 1v14M1 8h14M3.3 3.3l9.4 9.4M12.7 3.3l-9.4 9.4"/></svg></div>
      <div><div class="approach-title">Laundry Water Audit &amp; Equipment Calibration</div><div class="approach-body">Commercial laundry equipment assessed for actual fill volumes vs. programmed settings. Optimal fill levels calculated against typical load profiles. Equipment reprogrammed to minimum effective water volume. Average result: 20&ndash;30% reduction in laundry water consumption per cycle.</div></div>
    </div><div class="approach-item">
      <div class="approach-icon"><svg width="16" height="16" viewBox="0 0 16 16" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.5"><path d="M2 14l4-4 4 4 4-8"/></svg></div>
      <div><div class="approach-title">IoT Monitoring &mdash; HVAC, Laundry, &amp; Kitchen Sub-Circuits</div><div class="approach-body">Monitoring on HVAC make-up, laundry supply, kitchen, and main community supply. Night-time flow monitoring detects slow leaks in residential and mechanical areas. Consumption data structured for both operational management and Legionella water management programme documentation.</div></div>
    </div><div class="approach-item">
