      <div><div class="approach-title">ASHRAE 188 &amp; Legionella WMP Documentation Support</div><div class="approach-body">Water use monitoring data formatted to support the water management programme log requirements under ASHRAE 188 and CMS expectations for skilled nursing facilities. Cooling tower risk documentation and corrective action records maintained in WST's monitoring platform.</div></div>
